# --- Client build-time (Vite) -------------------------------------------------
# Baked into the browser bundle at `bun run build`. The client corpus fetch
# (/corpus) and any client-side API call go through this Cloudflare Worker URL,
# which injects the pokemontcg.io key server-side and adds an edge cache.
# Leave unset for local dev to hit the public origin (anonymous rate limit).
VITE_API_BASE=https://pokemon-tcg-proxy.<subdomain>.workers.dev

# --- Server runtime (Nitro / node .output/server/index.mjs) -------------------
# Read at runtime by the SSR server fetchers (src/server/card-data.ts). Same
# Worker URL. On the home server this lives in /etc/tcg/env (see deploy/DEPLOY.md),
# NOT in the client bundle. Falls back to the public origin if unset.
API_BASE=https://pokemon-tcg-proxy.<subdomain>.workers.dev

# --- Corpus crawl (CI only: .github/workflows/build-corpus.yml) ---------------
# The raw pokemontcg.io API key, used only by the corpus crawler that builds the
# /corpus blob and uploads it to R2. The production request key is the Worker
# secret; this is for the crawl job. Never shipped to the client.
# POKEMONTCG_API_KEY=...

# --- Supabase Cloud Vault (optional; unset = pure local-first) ----------------
# Two PUBLIC vars opt the app into the cloud Vault. When BOTH are set, the
# sign-in UI appears and a signed-in session persists the Vault in Postgres
# (RLS-isolated per user). When EITHER is missing, the app is exactly today's
# local-first IndexedDB Vault — no auth UI, no backend.
#
# The anon key is PUBLIC by design (RLS is the security boundary, not key
# secrecy). The values below are the well-known local-stack demo JWT printed by
# `supabase start` — a non-secret, safe to commit in this example.
#
# Self-host: create a Supabase project, run `supabase/migrations/*.sql`
# (`supabase db push`), then set these to your project's URL + anon key.
# NEVER put the service_role / secret key here — slice A needs only anon + RLS.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=http://localhost:55321
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJzdXBhYmFzZS1kZW1vIiwicm9sZSI6ImFub24iLCJleHAiOjE5ODM4MTI5OTZ9.CRXP1A7WOeoJeXxjNni43kdQwgnWNReilDMblYTn_I0
